    {
      "title": "Searching for the daughter",
      "text": "Walk south and Dig-below the Roots for a lump of Mud.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "If you do not have a pole and a plank, go north of Hamal's house and pick up one of each.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Run north to the lake, then west along the edge.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Use the mud on the tall tree, climb it.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Use your staff/pole on the clump of rocks.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Use your plank on the flat stone.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Stand next to the pile of rocks and listen to one of the shining pools.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Hello! Who are you!"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "So what exactly do you want from me?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "That sounds like something I can do."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "I'll get right on it."
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Use your plank on the flat stone again.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Yes."
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "title": "Peace and food",
      "text": "Talk to Hamal the Chieftain.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "About the people of Rellekka..."
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationText",
          "text": ""
        }
      ],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Talk to Jokul in the goat farm to the north.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Talk to Svidi wandering near the Fremennik lodestone.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Can't I persuade you to go in there somehow?"
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationText",
          "text": " I won't go in there unless I know it's safe."
        }
      ],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Go to the longhall in Rellekka, talk to Brundt the Chieftain about the Mountain Camp.  (If Lunar Diplomacy has been started or completed: )",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Ask about the Mountain Camp."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "[Any option]"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Ask about the Mountain Camp."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "[Any option]"
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Mine the ancient rock in the mountain camp's southern tent.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Return to Brundt the Chieftain in the longhall.  (If Lunar Diplomacy has been started or completed: )",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Ask about the Mountain Camp."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Ask about the Mountain Camp."
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationText",
          "text": " Really? Let me see!"
        }
      ],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Give the safety guarantee to Svidi.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Make your way to White Wolf Mountain<ul><li>If you have completed The Grand Tree, teleport to Al Kharid lodestone, run north-west and click on 'Glider Captain Dalbur'</li></ul>",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Sindarpos."
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Wearing leather gloves (or gauntlets), pick from the bush next to the gnome glider.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Eat the fruit.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Return to Hamal the Chieftain in the Mountain Camp.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "About your food supplies..."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "About the people of Rellekka..."
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationText",
          "text": ""
        }
      ],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "title": "The Kendal",
      "text": "Go to the centre of the lake and stand next to the pile of rocks.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Listen-to the shining pool again.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Jump-across the flat stone, falling into the water, and run east along the northern shore.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Chop down some of the small trees.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Enter the cave.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "If you've not fully completed both tasks in the section above and gone through the dialogue completely, you'll receive a message referring to a stench that prevents you from entering the cave. Repeat the tasks until you're allowed to enter the cave.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Talk to the Kendal.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "It's just me, no one special."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "You mean sacrifice?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "You look like a man in a bearsuit!"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Can I see that corpse?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Hand the body over to me!"
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationText",
          "text": " You demand nothing! You may have uncovered my disguise, but my claws can still tear you apart at will! I will not allow you to leave!"
        }
      ],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Kill the Kendal.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Take the corpse of woman next to all the skeletons.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "title": "The burial",
      "text": "Return to Hamal the Chieftain.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "But he killed your daughter!"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "I will."
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationText",
          "text": "(Continues below.)"
        }
      ],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Take 5 muddy rocks from the camp. They can be found around the mud pond and in the goat pen north of the tent.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Talk to Ragnar by the lake for Asleif's necklace.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Thank you. I will make sure she's given a proper burial now."
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationText",
          "text": ""
        }
      ],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Bury the corpse in the centre of the lake.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Use the rocks on the burial mound.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Quest complete!",
